# Frontend (`src/`)

## Stack

Next.js 16 App Router · React 19 · Tailwind 4 · GSAP · `@gsap/react` · shadcn-ready primitives (`src/components/ui`)

## Patterns

- Default to **Server Components**
- `"use client"` only for GSAP, event handlers, browser APIs
- Compose pages from section components under `src/components/landing/`
- Shared marketing copy/data: `src/lib/landing-content.ts`
- Class merging: `cn()` from `src/lib/utils.ts`
- Keep Next.js version-specific guidance in root `AGENTS.md` / auto-maintained Next agent files

## GSAP

- Register plugins once; prefer `useGSAP` for cleanup
- Desktop (≥768px): pinned horizontal sections scrub
- Mobile (<768px): native horizontal swipe — do **not** pin
- Magnetic buttons only on `(hover: hover) and (pointer: fine)`
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`

## Routes today

- `/` — landing
- `/signup`, `/login`, `/forgot-password`, `/reset-password`, `/verify` — auth
- `/dashboard`, `/editor` — authenticated app (cookie gate in proxy)
- `/{slug}` — public published portfolio

## Do not

- Introduce Inter/system fonts or purple SaaS defaults
- Put heavy animation logic inside Server Components
- Reintroduce a separate Express API package
